ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator using Gemini Models
Brainstorming & Ideation
ComicCraft can be envisioned as an AI-powered creative studio that helps users turn a simple idea into a complete comic story using Gemini models.
💡 Core Idea
A user enters a simple prompt such as:
“A school student discovers a robot buried under his house.”
ComicCraft transforms it into:
Idea → Story → Characters → Scenes → Dialogue → Comic Panels → Final Comic
🚀 Feature Ideas
•	AI Story Generator — Generate a beginning, middle, climax, and ending from a short idea.
•	Genre Selection — Adventure, comedy, fantasy, sci-fi, horror, romance, mystery, superhero, etc.
•	Character Creator — Generate names, personalities, backgrounds, abilities, and visual descriptions.
•	Character Consistency — Keep character traits and appearances consistent throughout the story.
•	Scene Generator — Break the story into individual scenes and panels.
•	AI Dialogue — Generate speech bubbles appropriate to each character.
•	Narration & Captions — Automatically create narration boxes and scene descriptions.
•	Comic Style Selection — Cartoon, manga-inspired, superhero, children's comic, noir, etc.
•	Story Editing — Let users regenerate or modify individual scenes without recreating the entire comic.
•	Multiple Endings — Generate alternative endings for the same story.
•	Panel Layout Suggestions — Recommend layouts such as 2×2, 3-panel strip, full-width climax panel, etc.
•	Comic Export — Export the completed comic as PDF or image pages.
•	Save & Continue — Store projects so users can continue editing later.
