🎯 Interesting Innovation Ideas
To make the project more than a basic AI story generator, you could add:
1.	Story Director Mode
Gemini acts like a director and decides pacing, scene transitions, dramatic moments, and panel composition.
2.	What Happens Next?
At any point, the user can ask the AI to generate several possible continuations.
3.	Mood Control
Users select moods such as funny, emotional, dark, suspenseful, or epic, and Gemini adapts the story and dialogue.
4.	Character Memory
Maintain a structured character profile so recurring characters behave consistently.
5.	Interactive Comic
Let readers make choices that influence the next scene.
6.	Text-to-Comic Mode
A single paragraph becomes an entire multi-panel comic automatically.
7.	Comic Doctor
Analyze an existing story and suggest improvements to pacing, dialogue, character development, and plot consistency.
🏆 Possible Unique Selling Point
“From one sentence to a complete comic.”
The strongest demonstration would be a user entering a single creative idea and watching ComicCraft progressively produce the story → characters → panels → dialogue → finished comic.
